Package: wickrabacktest
Type: Package
Title: Wickra Backtest Engine (R Binding)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("kingchenc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@wickra.org")
Description: R binding for the wickra-backtest engine. It calls the engine's
    stable C ABI from compiled C glue via .Call, returning the backtest report
    as a JSON string that is byte-identical to the Rust, Python, Node.js, WASM,
    C#, Java and Go bindings.
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
Suggests: jsonlite
URL: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-backtest,
    https://wickra-lib.r-universe.dev
BugReports: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-backtest/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: the wickra-backtest C ABI shared library. Build it with
    `cargo build -p wickra-backtest-c --release`, then set WKBT_INC to
    bindings/c/include and WKBT_LIB to the directory holding the built library.
    There is no automatic download yet.
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
